 ays and Thursdays from 12 pm to 3 pm outside the San Francisco Public Libr
 ary\, featuring three performers each day spanning a mix of genres and loc
 al talent.\n\nNew for 2026: A rotating lineup of food trucks will join the
  festivities\, turning the plaza into a lively midday hangout for downtown
  workers\, residents\, and anyone looking for a free break with live music
 .\nLaunched in 2024\, the series has hosted more than 100 free concerts an
 d is part of ongoing efforts to activate public spaces in the Civic Center
  neighborhood.\n\nCivic Center Soundtrack 2026\nWhen: Tuesdays & Thursdays
 \, 12 pm to 3 pmDates: April 14 through October 2026Where: Fulton Plaza (o
