CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Clift Royal Sonesta Hotel 
 is extending its popular Redwood Room After Dark entertainment series with
  two evenings of live jazz each week through October.\nPresented every Thu
 rsday and Friday in the legendary Redwood Room\, the expanded calendar wil
 l showcase an impressive roster of acclaimed musicians\, including Sundra 
 Manning\, Grant Levin\, Eamon Flynn\, Glen Pearson\, David Udolf\, and oth
 er notable performers.\n\nCurated with artistic inspiration from Grammy-no
 minated singer\, composer and cultural ambassador Sacha Boutros and founde
 r of Hear Me Roar Entertainment*\, the series brings together world-class 
 musicianship\, timeless cocktails and the unmistakable glamour of one of S
 an Francisco’s most storied nightlife destinations. *Hear Me Roar Entert
 ainment promotes women\, minorities\, and underrepresented voices in the a
 rts through inclusive entertainment\, bespoke cultural programming\, and c
 reative collaboration that foster diversity\, empowerment\, and community 
 connection.\n“Live music has always been an important part of the Redwoo
 d Room’s identity\,” said Dania Duke\, General Manager of The Clift Ro
 yal Sonesta Hotel. “Expanding Redwood Room After Dark to two evenings ea
 ch week allows us to showcase an extraordinary range of artists while givi
 ng San Franciscans and visitors even more opportunities to experience this
  legendary setting.”\nOctober Performances\nThursday\, October 1: Glen P
 earson Duo\nFriday\, October 2: Grant Levin\nThursday\, October 8: Glen P.
 ..\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.redwoodroomsf.com/\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/clift-hotels-redwood-room-free-live-jazz-night-sf/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
