 lax\, making it an easy outing for all ages. Admission is free\, and compl
 imentary ferry service from the San Francisco Ferry Building is available 
 with RSVP.\n\nWhat to Expect:\nOne Island. 15+ Creators. Multiple Cuisines
 .\nMore than 15 food creators per event span Vietnamese\, Korean\, Japanes
 e\, Hawaiian\, Mexican\, Italian\, German\, BBQ\, fried chicken\, sandwich
 es\, and sweets. There’s something for every craving\, from go-to favori
 tes to something entirely new.\nA Waterfront Setting with Unbeatable Views
 \nCityside Park spans six acres along the shoreline\, with open lawns\, wi
 de promenades\, and views that stretch from the Bay Bridge to the Golden G
 ate. Settle in\, explore the park\, and take in the full sweep of the Bay.
 \nKites Over the Bay\nThe signature kite program returns\, with compliment
 ary kites available with signup. By midday\, the sky fills with color\, cr
 eating one of the most shareable scenes of the season.\nAn Island Adventur
 e Eight Minutes from the Ferry Building\nLeave the city and arrive somewhe
 re that feels nothing like it. Just eight minutes by ferry from downtown S
