DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCome hear the five-piece Adria
 n West Band perform in the beergarden at Waterhawk Lake Club in Rohnert Pa
 rk! Free show\, all ages (tips appreciated). We play from 4 – 7pm.\nAdri
 an West Band is a five-piece acoustic rock ensemble from Oakland. They pla
 y a fun mix of originals\, covers and instrumentals plus a bit of jazz. So
 me have described their sound as “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”.\n\n
 Adrian enjoys setting philosophical lyrics to joyful music. His topics may
  veer a tad dark at times but the underlying music is uplifting\, giving t
 he listener a richly layered experience. Whether he’s telling a story ab
 out a skinny-dipping episode gone awry or grappling with some major challe
 nge facing humanity\, his lyrics are infused with equal parts hope\, reali
 sm and whimsy.\nAdrian West – vocals\, acoustic guitar\, elec. violin & 
 live looping\nLarisa Roberts – vocals\, percussion\nChris Haag – alto 
 sax\nJJ Hartmann – upright bass\nNick Sager – drums\nBand website: www
 .adrianwest.com\n——\nBrewsters Beer Garden is located in the historic 
 district of downtown Petaluma. We are an open-air dining restaurant with o
 ver 350 seats.\nOur cuisine is focused on technique driven dishes influenc
 ed by Southern Carolina BBQ and a smattering of locally sourced and sustai
 nably raised Petaluma producers and ranchers. Think southern BBQ meets Cal
 ifornia produce with a refined touch of explosive flavors.\nThe dining spa
 ce compliments the food perfectly as guests are treated to outdoor seating
 ...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://adrianwest.com\nDetails: https://sf.funche
 ap.com/adrian-west-band-33/\nSource: Funcheap SF
