BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:5th Annual Afro Latinx Concert (Bayview Opera House)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638179@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerGet ready to dance\, celebrate
 \, and connect at a vibrant night of Afro Latinx music\, food\, and art!\n
 \nCelebrate the 5th Annual Afro Latinx Concert!\nJoin us for a vibrant nig
 ht of Afro Latinx culture\, music\, and community at the historic Ruth Wil
 liams Opera House in San Francisco.\nTaking place during Latino Heritage M
 onth on October 3\, 2026\, this annual celebration highlights the rich art
 istic traditions and cultural contributions of Afro Latinx communities thr
 ough powerful live performances.\nHosted by Oakland’s own Gina Madrid\nP
 ERFORMING LIVE\nLos Rakas are Grammy Award-winning Panamanian-American pio
 neers of “Panabay” music\, blending hip-hop\, reggae\, dancehall\, and
  Latin rhythms into an energetic\, genre-defying sound. Known for their el
 ectrifying live performances\, they celebrate Afro-Latino culture\, identi
 ty\, and the global spirit of the Bay Area.\nThis year\, we’re excited t
 o welcome Guanaco from Ecuador—an internationally acclaimed hip-hop arti
 st whose powerful blend of rap\, Latin rhythms\, and cultural storytelling
