BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SPAM New Media Festival (Santa Cruz)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639854@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Design: Wyatt OlsonSPAM New Media Festival began in 2022 as a 
 grassroots experimental arts platform\, bringing together practitioners wo
 rking on the fringes and frontiers of digital arts through exhibitions\, p
 erformances\, and critical discussions.\nSPAM’s organizers and curators 
 are a collective of artists\, researchers\, and academics who are bugging 
 the system — imagining resistance narratives against capital-driven medi
 a through multiplicity\, embodiment\, and critical practice.\nFor SPAM’s
  2026 iteration we’re gathering October 9–11\, 2026\, at Indexical in 
 Santa Cruz\, CA to share the work of artists we love with the greater San 
 Francisco Bay Area community through performances\, workshops\, and artist
  talks.\nThe 2026 lineup features regional projects by Dorothy Santos & Ab
 ram Stern\, Ava Koohbor\, Jean Carla Rodea\, and EPOCH\, alongside the tou
 ring projects of Sunken Cages and Rohan Chander.\nSPAM 2026 is organized i
 n collaboration with Indexical and SrcMaterial. Indexical is generously ho
 sting the event\, supporting the performances\, and creating a space for g
 athering and relationality. SrcMaterial is curating Allaboration\, a works
 hop series focused on technological literacy — with an emphasis on AI\, 
 collaboration\, and connection in an era of increasingly asynchronous work
 spaces.\nSPAM is an ongoing project of regrowth and persistence. We are co
 mmitted to creating discourse from the margins\, developing pathways of in
 terconnectivity for our future selves.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.ind
 exical.org/tags/spam\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/spam-media-festival
 -santa-cruz/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SPAMPo
 ster.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Indexical\, 1050 River St. #119 Santa Cruz\, CA 95060
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/spam-media-festival-santa-cruz/
END:VEVENT
