DESCRIPTION:Uniqlo SF Grand Reopening Weekend w/ Street Fest\, Discounts &
  Giveaways (Oct. 9-11)\nUNIQLO USA\nUNIQLO Market Street celebrates its gr
 and opening with a free street festival (Oct 9) on Ellis Street between St
 ockton and Powell. The event includes DJ sets on two stages\, interactive 
 art and science activities\, street soccer\, Japanese calligraphy and orig
 ami workshops\, food vendors\, giveaways\, and six large-scale Market Stre
 et art cubes by Bay Area artists.\nUNIQLO’s new 2-floor\, 20\,000 sqft D
 owntown SF location is at 801 Market Street\, the old “Old Navy” locat
 ion\, a 1907 building at Market and 4th. UNIQLO previously had a flagship 
 store in Union Square which closed down in March 2021. So a little more th
 an 5 years later\, UNIQLO is back in downtown.\nPlus there are deals\, per
 formances and giveaways all weekend at the store.\n\nUNIQLO Market Street 
 – Opening Weekend 2026\nAddress: 801 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA 9410
 3\n\nOpening Weekend Hours\nOct 9 Fri 10am – 8pm\nOct 10 Sat 10am – 8p
 m\nOct 11 Sun 10am – 7pm\n\nKnot Bag Giveaway\nFirst 500 Customers in Li
 ne Each Day Get a *free Knot Bag with Uniqlo-Exclusive Goodies\, Pocky\, D
 andelion Chocolate Bar\, and A Treat from Boudin Bakery.\n\nLots of Exclus
 ive Offers\nOnly at Market Street from 10/9 – 10/15 – save up to 30% o
 ff select items\n\nBreakfast Giveaway\nFirst 500 customers making any purc
 hase on Friday 10/9 through Sunday 10/11 will receive a FREE voucher towar
 ds a breakfast treat!\n\nTaiko Performance\nExperience a traditional Japan
 ese taiko drum per...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.uniqlo.com/us/en/spe
 cial-feature/store-openings/san-francisco-market-street\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/uniqlo-sf-grand-reopening-weekend-w-discounts-giveaways-oc
 t-9-11/\nSource: Funcheap SF
