BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bridging The Gap: An Evening of Indian Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638629@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerNazan Aktaswith Nazan Aktas (C
 ello) & William Rossel (Tabla)\n​Nazan Aktas (cello) & William Rossel (t
 abla) will present a performance of afternoon and evening ragas in the sty
 les of the North Indian\, Maihar and Lucknow gharanas. This performance wi
 ll highlight the versatility of the cello and tabla as both solo and accom
 panying instruments\, as each player will take turns accompanying the othe
 r. The cello (being a relatively new instrument to Indian music) and tabla
  together will bridge the gap between old & new in the hopes of sharing th
 e beautiful music of the North Indian Classical tradition.\n​In Person O
 nly at the SF Dharma Collective\, 2929 24th Street.\n\n​Nazan Aktas is a
  cellist based in Northern California who has performed with many artists\
 , ensembles and orchestras throughout the Bay Area and beyond. She has bee
 n studying at the Ali Akbar College of Music since 2015\, under the tutela
 ge of Alam Khan\, son of Maestro Ali Akbar Khan. She has also studied voca
 l music with Ranjana Ghatak\, disciple of Pandit Ajoy Chakraborty and rece
 ived further instruction from cellist Saskia Rao-de Haas\, who studied wit
 h Pandit Hariprasad Chaurasia. She is a graduate of Sonoma State Universit
 y\, with a Bachelor of Music Degree with a double concentration in Perform
 ance and Jazz Studies and has a Master’s Degree from Berklee College of 
 Music in Contemporary Performance.\n​William Rossel is an internationall
 y recognized Tabla player\, educator\, and archivist. A se...\n\nFree\n\nT
 ickets: https://events.humanitix.com/bridging-the-gap-an-evening-of-indian
 -music?c=funcheap\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/bridging-gap-evening-i
 ndian-music/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bridgi
 ng-the-Gap-funcheap.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Dharma Collective\, 2929 24th Street
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/bridging-gap-evening-indian-music/
END:VEVENT
