DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAnthony Arya\n\nHosted monthly
  by Anthony Arya\, SF Unplugged is a night of acoustic music at North Beac
 h’s Paname featuring nationally known songwriters.\n\nSan Francisco Unpl
 ugged\nSAT October 10TH @ 7 PM (doors 6:30 pm)\n\nGuest Artist Tristan Lak
 e Leabu\; Hosted by Anthony Arya\nWelcome to a show like no other at Panam
 e Nightclub on the historic Broadway street in North Beach. Enjoy national
 ly recognized singer/songwriters\, unique cocktails & beverages\, and ligh
 t Parisian fare from next door’s Paris 75 menu.\nFor limited premium res
 erved seats\, purchase your tickets in advance for this night-on-the-town 
 event. General Admission $20 at the door.\n\n———————-\nMeet 
 your host\, Anthony Arya\n\nBorn in SF and raised in the Bay\, bringing lo
 cal roots and a passion for building community through live music.\nNation
 ally recognized singer-songwriter and alumnus of NBC’s The Voice (Season
  15).\nPresidential Scholar in the Arts for Songwriting\nInternational Son
 gwriting Competition Finalist\; Bluebird Cafe Golden Pick Contest Winner\n
 spent years performing across the Bay Area and nationwide\, connecting wit
 h top-tier songwriters and artists along the way.\nFour studio albums blen
 ding indie folk\, acoustic roots\, and classic americana story-driven song
 writing.\nHost and curator of SF Unplugged\, dedicated to stripping away t
 he noise to bring the country’s finest acoustic storytellers to intimate
  San Francisco stages every month.\n\n——————–\nYour October
 ’s Guest Artist\, TRISTAN LAKE...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/san-francisco-unplugged-in-north-beach-tristan-lake-leabu-ant
 hony-arya-tickets-2000775486339\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-unplu
 gged-north-beach-tristan-lake-leabu-anthony-arya/\nSource: Funcheap SF
