SUMMARY:Palace
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17254446@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nPalace\n\nSaturday\, October 10 | The Wa
 rfield\n\nIf tickets in the accessible section are unavailable\, please re
 ach out to the venue for accommodations. Please note\, orders in violation
  of the published ticket limit are subject to cancellation without notice.
  Ticket prices may fluctuate\, at any time\, based on demand\n\nPALACE ARE
  BACK WITH “KID” AND MASSIVE TOUR OF USA + CANADA\n\nPalace have been 
 making music together for over a decade. What started out as carefree jam 
 sessions between Leo Wyndham\, Rupert Turner and Matt Hodges in an airless
  studio in North London has burgeoned into a project that has amassed a gl
 obal audience more akin to a community than a fanbase.\n\nTheir early EPs 
 - Lost In The Night (2014) and Chase The Light (2015) - were recorded in t
 he band’s beloved aforementioned studio\, The Arch\, and established a D
 IY ethos that remains intrinsic to the spirit of the band to this day. Fou
 r albums followed\; So Long Forever (2016)\, Life After (2019)\, Shoals (2
 022) and Ultrasound (2024): each one a musical exploration of a particular
  feeling in a particular place during a particular time\; ranging from gri
 ef and the loss of a relationship to the emergence of new love and light. 
 Consequently\, it's not easy to sonically classify Palace. Their sound var
 ies from the atmospheric and ethereal to the more grounded notes of Blues 
 and Americana\, yet in every song there is still something remarkably iden
 tifiable as Palace: an ineffability to the feelings conjured up...\n\nAll 
 Ages\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.axs.com/events/1418838/
 palace-tickets?skin=warfield&src=AEGLIVE_WWRFLSFO022715VEN001?cid=usaffdos
 tuff\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/palace-tickets\nSour
 ce: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31637442/ac184779-abf4-4402-a254-19ab3b7487bd.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/palace-tickets
END:VEVENT
