DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSmall Dog WorkshopJoin us at t
 he next Contra Costa Vintage Market on Sunday\, October 11th from 10am-3pm
  in beautiful downtown Lafayette\, California!\nThis East Bay gathering sh
 owcases a curated lineup of the Bay Area’s top vintage dealers and bring
 s community together every second Sunday of the month for a day of treasur
 e hunting\, shopping\, relaxing\, connecting\, and soaking up good vibes!\
 n\nSpend the day discovering one-of-a-kind treasures\, timeless finds\, an
 d thoughtful gifts at one vintage market in two separate parking lots off 
 Mt. Diablo Blvd in the heart of downtown Lafayette\, California.\nMake a d
 ay of it! The market is perfectly situated between amazing brunch spots\, 
 yummy cafes\, fun local bars\, delicious restaurants\, and premier indepen
 dent specialty boutiques!\n*Free Admission\n*Free Street Parking\n*Bartabl
 e (Lafayette Station)\n*30 Experienced Vintage Vendors\n*4 Talented Live M
 usicians\n*Beer Garden at the Roundup Saloon Bar\n*Family Game Room at All
  Ages Play Recreation\n*Pick up a site map at Vintage Vida Store (3581 Mt.
  Diablo Blvd. Lafayette)\n*For more details follow @contracostavintagemark
 et\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/contracostavintagemarket\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/contra-costa-vintage-market-october-lafa
