UID:funcheap-1636353@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Big Art Loop: “Waterfront Walkabout” Free SF Art Stroll (E
 mbarcadero)\nPoster Art by Hollis Callas\n\nSan Francisco’s new event se
 ries where live music\, interactive pop-ups\, & monumental art set the sta
 ge for a bayside stroll like no other!\n\nLaunching September 17 and retur
 ning monthly every third Thursday this fall\, Waterfront Walkabout is a fr
 ee series inviting you to experience the Big Art Loop – Portside as the 
 Embarcadero waterfront comes to life!\nDate: Thursday\, Sept 17\, 2026\nTi
 me: 5:00 PM – 8:00 PM\nLocation: Pier 14 to the Exploratorium\n\nOur eve
 nt is a series 3 events in the fall. The event will be taking place every 
 third Thursday of each month. September 17\, October 15th\, and November 1
 9th.\nWHAT TO EXPECT\nSoak in live music\, fresh oysters\, and drinks at t
 he Ferry Building’s front plaza\, then stroll the art trail to discover 
 playful pop-up experiences at four larger-than-life sculptures:\nCorpus (P
 ier 14): Step up to the glowing Shrimp Boat Art Car for beats by the bay\n
 Echoes (Ferry Terminal Plaza): Grab a paintbrush for outdoor Paint & Sip o
 r join interactive games with Playful SF and Chamber of Connection\n🧜 C
 oralee (Pier 1/2): Dive into mermaid crafts and enchanting water spirit st
 orytelling with En2Action\n️ Got Framed (Pier 7): Strike a pose on the p
 ier for free professional portraits\nGUIDED ART TOURS\nExplore at your own
  pace\, or join a free docent-led tour for a deeper dive into the stories 
 behind the four featured sculptures! These 60-minute guided walks depart f
 rom...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/waterfront-walkabo
 ut-free-sf-art-stroll-tickets-1998986624806?aff=oddtdtcreator&amp\;keep_tl
 d=true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/big-art-loop-waterfront-walkabout
 -free-sf-art-stroll-embarcadero/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Waterf
 ront_Walkabout_FLYER.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The event stretches from Pier 14 to the Exploratorium\, 1 Ferry B
 uilding San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/big-art-loop-waterfront-walkabout-free-sf-art-
 stroll-embarcadero/
END:VEVENT
