DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\nIn the Round\nLost King
 s\nThursday\, October 15 | ​The Independent\n\nConsisting of the Los Ang
 eles-based duo Rob Gainley and Nick Shanholtz\, Lost Kings have emerged as
  a powerhouse within the electronic music scene\, amassing over one billio
 n streams globally and capturing the attention of nearly a million monthly
  listeners on Spotify. Known for their unique sound and dynamic production
 \, Lost Kings have collaborated with major artists like Wiz Khalifa\, A$AP
  Ferg\, Ty Dolla $ign\, Mod Sun\, Loren Gray\, Marc E. Bassy\, GASHI\, and
  many more\, showcasing their ability to elevate each collaboration with t
 heir distinctive style.\n\nFrom their debut single “Bad” in 2015 to re
 cent releases like “Here For You”\, “Remind Me”\, and “Dreams\,
 ” Lost Kings have proven their versatility and staying power in the indu
 stry. Their catalog includes popular EPs such as Paper Crowns and Lost Ang
 eles (2019) and It’s Not You\, It’s Me (2021)\, with each project rein
 forcing their reputation as hitmakers. Beyond streaming success\, the duo 
 has captivated audiences with standout performances at iconic festivals li
 ke Coachella and Lollapalooza\, and have sold out shows in major markets a
 cross North America. In 2025\, Lost Kings are entering a bold new chapter 
 by embracing speed house. The duo aims to bring an American twist to the g
 enre\, fusing its underground energy with their commercial successes. With
  this shift\, they’re poised to redefine their sound and further expand 
 their reach...\n\n18+\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents: In the Round
 \n\nTickets: https://www.theindependentsf.com/tm-event/lost-kings-2/?fbcli
 d=IwY2xjawT8CptwZG9mAWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAGJyaWQRMXk3R2FRb3RtV0VPQlZXbFRzcnRjBm
 FwcF9pZBAyMjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEeoBBhXbG__oi40ptBAN0cObszxGSHJuORQxKRvms0
 437lhOhcUvMyl7_AuKM_aem_qM05W2isN7c2E2lvfjZtLg\nDetails: https://dothebay.
 com/events/2026/10/15/lost-kings-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7755362;-122.4376556
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34069164/284f1d4d-0917-40af-bdeb-4f8b5ce4252f.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Independent\, 628 Divisadero Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94
