SUMMARY:14th Annual “Bayview In Motion” Health Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639860@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:SFPUC/SECC\n\nThe Southeast Community Center Presents: The 14t
 h Annual District 10 Health Fest: Bayview in Motion! Saturday\, October 17
 \, 11AM – 4PM.\n\nThis dynamic\, community-centered wellness celebration
  merges movement\, prevention\, sustainability and neighborhood pride into
  one exciting festival at the SECC featuring health screenings and educati
 on\, entertainment and food trucks.\nThis year’s theme\, Bayview in Moti
 on\, celebrates movement\, wellness\, and community for a day of health\, 
 healing\, and collective joy in San Francisco’s District 10. This annual
  event will highlight the importance of holistic well-being through fun ac
