BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joe Bataan
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:dothebay-17207819@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Yerba Buena Gardens Festival\, KALW Music\, & MoAD present\nJo
 e Bataan\nSaturday\, October 17 | ​Yerba Buena Gardens\n\nFREE show with
  the legendary Joe Bataan in San Francisco\, only at Yerba Buena Gardens F
 estival! With opening set from MeloDious and pre-show music from KALW DJ M
 arcus.\n\nFestival favorite Joe Bataan\, a Latin music legend since the mi
 d-1960s\, returns to the Gardens for his third performance in the past fou
 r years. He made an indelible mark as one of the early stars of Fania Reco
 rds with a seductive combination of doo-wop vocals and boogaloo\, one of t
 he era’s defining sounds. Born Bataan Nitollano to a Filipino father and
  African-American mother and raised in Spanish Harlem\, he is the father o
 f the Latin soul sound\, crooning hits like “Gypsy Woman” and “Ordin
 ary Guy.” But Bataan never stayed in one groove for long. He went on to 
 expand his sound in the ’70s with his Ghetto Records releases\, co-coini
 ng the apt moniker “salsoul\,” though he adapted to changing currents 
 at the end of the decade with forays into disco and hip-hop (scoring the e
 arly rap hit “Rap-O Clap-O” in 1979). Stepping back from performing in
  the early ‘80s\, he largely disappeared from the scene while working as
  a youth counselor in detention facilities. It’s a dramatic story that h
 e recounts with humor and searing detail in his 2024 memoir Streetology: T
 he Legacy of the Afro-Filipino\, King of Latin Soul. Since returning to mu
 sic in 2005\, he’s reclaimed his crown and is still going strong in his 
 80s\, a...\n\nFree\nYerba Buena Gardens Festival\, KALW Music\, & MoAD pre
 sent\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventb
 rite.com%2Fe%2Fjoe-bataan-at-ybg-festival-tickets-1986362430501%3Faff%3Dod
 dtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/joe-bataan-ti
 ckets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/cere
 mony/
GEO:37.7850153;-122.4023464
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31425267/44ddb0b1-b70f-4701-8c51-1ec038bad50b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Gardens covers two square city blocks bounded by Miss
 ion\, Folsom\, Third and Fourth Streets.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/joe-bataan-tickets
END:VEVENT
