BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kylie Cantrall
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17696597@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:If tickets in the accessible section are unavailable\, please 
 reach out to the venue for accommodations. Please note\, orders in violati
 on of the published ticket limit are subject to cancellation without notic
 e. Ticket prices may fluctuate\, at any time\, based on demand.\n\nMultihy
 phenate actress\, singer and songwriter Kylie Cantrall played the lead tit
 le character ‘Red\,’ the daughter of the Queen of Hearts in Disney’s
  hit film “Descendants: The Rise of Red.” Following the massive succes
 s of the film\, Kylie performed in “Descendants/Zombies: Worlds Collide 
 Tour\,” a live concert experience which sold-out 40 arenas across North 
 America. Kylie returned as ‘Red' to lead the sequel “Descendants: Wick
 ed Wonderland\,” which premiered on Disney+ in July 2026.\n\nLast year\,
  Kylie released her highly anticipated debut EP titled “B.O.Y.” throug
 h Artist Partner Group which included her singles “Boy for a Day\,” 
 “Goodie Bag\,” “Denim\,” and “See U Tonight.” In 2026\, Kylie 
 kicks off her new partnership with Republic Records\, debuting her brand-n
 ew EP Valley Girl Problems out July 24th. Produced by Tricky Stewart (Riha
 nna\, Tyla) and written alongside Tayla Parx\, the nine-track project mark
 s a bold new chapter for Kylie continuing her evolution as both an artist 
 and a cultural voice for a new generation.\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice Presen
