DESCRIPTION:Leap Sandcastle ClassicOn Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, Leap 
 Arts in Education will take over Ocean Beach for its 44th annual Sandcastl
 e Classic\, Northern California’s largest sandcastle competition. Teams 
 of local students\, architects\, engineers\, designers\, contractors\, and
  corporate teams will work together to transform the beach into a sprawlin
 g showcase of giant sand sculptures.\nSince 1983\, Leap has hosted the San
 dcastle Classic as a fundraiser for Bay Area arts education programs. The 
 free community event brings more than 5\,000 people to Ocean Beach each ye
 ar to watch teams build elaborate sculptures on an impressive scale\, with
  local elementary school students working alongside professional designers
  and builders.\nBring a blanket\, grab a bite\, and spend the day at the b
 each watching the sculptures take shape. The event is free to attend\, and
  the competition culminates with judging and an awards ceremony.\n\n2026 S
 andcastle Classic\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026\nThe 2026 event will mark 
 the 44th annual Sandcastle Classic. Teams are typically made up of archite
 cts\, engineers\, contractors\, designers\, corporations\, and local eleme
 ntary school students who work together to design and construct giant sand
  sculptures. Money raised by participating teams and sponsors helps Leap p
 rovide arts programs to Bay Area students.\nA few things to know:\n\nThe S
 andcastle Classic is free for the public to attend.\nMore than 5\,000 peop
 le typically come out to Ocean Beach for the event.\nMore than 25 lo...\n\
 nFree\n\nTickets: https://leapsandcastleclassic.org/\nDetails: https://sf.
 funcheap.com/leap-arts-annual-sandcastle-classic/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Copy-o
 f-M03A7031-scaled.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Ocean Beach\, 1000 Great Highway\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/leap-arts-annual-sandcastle-classic/
END:VEVENT
