DESCRIPTION:Fisherman's Wharf CBD\nClam chowder in a sourdough bowl\, step
 s from Fisherman’s Wharf iconic piers — this October\, that’s the wh
 ole afternoon. The Fisherman’s Wharf Chowder Fest brings 8–12 local re
 staurants together to compete for the title of San Francisco’s Best Clam
  Chowder\, judged live on the waterfront.\n\nFree to attend — watch the 
 competition\, shop the marketplace\, enjoy free activities and catch the e
 ntertainment at no cost.\nWant to taste the best clam chowder in San Franc
 isco yourself? Grab a Taster’s Pass while supplies last!\n\nWhat to Expe
 ct\n\nLive chowder competition — 8–12 SF restaurants go head-to-head f
 or San Francisco’s Best Clam Chowder\, Best Theme & Display\, and the Pe
 ople’s Choice.\nJudged live — San Francisco culinary tastemakers score
  every entry right in front of the crowd.\nYour vote counts — Ticket hol
 ders vote for People’s Choice via QR code.\nMarketplace & outdoor bars 
 — food\, drink\, and retail vendors line the Wharf all afternoon.\nLive 
 entertainment — enjoy live music\, demonstrations\, and competition upda
 tes from the host and judges\nFree activities — photo ops\, workshops\, 
 and lawn games\, all included with general admission.\n\nGrab Your Pass\nF
 ree General Admission — FREE Watch the competition\, browse the marketpl
 ace\, and enjoy the entertainment. No ticket required to attend — but th
 is tier doesn’t include chowder tastings or a People’s Choice vote.\nT
 aster’s Hungry Pass — $50 (limited availability onsite\, pre-purchase 
 highly encouraged) Your ticket to the act...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/fishermans-wharf-chowder-fest-tickets-2000661026988#lo
 cation\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/chowder-fest-sfs-clam-chowder-sho
 wdown-fishermans-wharf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Chowde
 r-Fest-2026-8.5x11.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:2860 Taylor Street San Francisco\, CA 94133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/chowder-fest-sfs-clam-chowder-showdown-fisherm
 ans-wharf/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bay Beats Launch Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17914040@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Bay Beats is rolling out 150 new albums onto our website this 
 fall\, and to celebrate we're throwing our Fourth Annual Launch Party at t
 he Bandshell in Golden Gate Park. Each of the awesome\, featured artists i
 s new to Bay Beats in 2026:\n\n2:00 - Spencer Noble - @goodforyourbones\; 
 Pop\n\n3:00 - Frankie Maston - @frankiemaston\; Afropop\n\n4:00 - William 
 Johnston's Extravagant Superband - @williamjohnstonbohrer\; Soul/funk\n\n5
 :00 - Skip the Needle - @skiptheneedle\; Rock\n\nThis exciting lineup refl
 ects the range of styles that makes Bay Beats an integral part of the Bay 
 Area's vibrant music scene. Come out to the park and dance and sway to fou
 r dazzling bands!\n\nBut wait\, there's more: giveaways\, food trucks and 
 games! This show is also brought to you by SFPL's James C. Hormel LGBTQIA 
 Center\, Illuminate\, Amoeba Music\, White Crate\, BFF.fm\, and the San Fr
 ancisco Recreation and Parks Dept. Come meet them and other music organiza
 tions at the show. And when you get here\, don't forget to put your hands 
