DESCRIPTION:Community StreetsWiggle Fest Fall 2026 is a family-friendly ne
 ighborhood gathering at Wiggle Plaza featuring free BBQ\, potluck and gril
 led cheese\, live local music and dancing\, games\, arts and crafts\, live
  portrait drawing\, face painting\, and a bouncy house. The event also off
 ers an opportunity to meet neighbors and learn about local community organ
 izations.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_It’s Wiggle Fest Fall 2026 time
 ! 🎺💃🍦🌭🕺🥳\nJoin us Sunday October 25th for 2 blocks of fa
 mily-friendly activities on Wiggle Plaza including:\n• Free BBQ\, Potluc
 k & Grilled Cheese 🧀🌭\n• Live Local Music & Dancing 🎶💃\n• 
 Puzzles & Interactive Games 🧩🪱\n• Arts & Crafts 🎨\n• Live Por
 trait Drawing ✍️\n• Face Painting 👨‍🎨\n• Bouncy House & Mo
 re! 🏰\nCome meet your neighbors while enjoying a relaxing day at Wiggle
  Plaza and learn about the amazing work our local community orgs are doing
  to make the neighborhood safer & more vibrant!\n@wiggleplaza @dubocetrian
 gleneighborhood @friendsofdubocepark @sfbike @maitrisf @sutterhealth\nPost
 er design by @alexajriddle\nSee you there! 🙌_\nText extracted from prov
 ided image:\nWIGGLEFEST\nOCTOBER 25TH\nSTEINER @ HERMANN\n12PM-4PM\nBBQ 
 • GAMES • FACE PAINTING • LIVE MUSIC\nARTS & CRAFTS • BOUNCE HOUSE
  • & MORE!\n\n@communitystreetssf\nCommunity Streets\nWe help neighbors 
 produce community events that bring people together and make our city safe
 r. Join us!\ncommunitystreetssf.org/join-us\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ww
 w.instagram.com/p/DeFJj64Ggc5/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;stkn=NTc4M
 TIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/wiggle-fest-fall-2026-free-b
 bq-grilled-cheese-block-party-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
