BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Napa $5 Folk Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T170000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639464@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Jason EcklA $5 music festival in Napa? That’s right!\nNot Lo
 ud Concerts presents the Napa $5 Folk Festival on Oct 25 from 2 – 5 pm.\
 nThis is a festival like no other – 9 bands\, 3 stages\, all indoors in 
 downtown Napa\, and all not too loud! Stroll between the stages hearing am
 azing internationally touring bands\, local favorites\, and a few surprise
 s. Presented by Not Loud Concerts\, this event takes out all of the hassle
 s and discomfort of modern music festivals and puts the audience and music
 ian’s comfort first. Best of all\, admission is only $5.\n\nThe festival
  is held entirely indoors in the historic Native Sons of the Gold West (on
  Coombs)\, in multiple rooms on a couple of different floors. Large bands 
 will be featured in the grand ballroom\, acoustic-based bands will perform
  intimate sets in the wood paneled meeting room\, and in the dance room th
 ere will be folk dancing lessons and some surprise acts.\nIndoor bathrooms
 \, chairs to sit in\, room to dance and\, of course\, sound reinforcement 
 that is not too loud make this festival one of a kind. All of this for jus
 t $5.\nThere is lots of nearby\, free\, parking and there are elevators in
  the hall\, along with chairs in every room. The friendly folks at the Nat
 ive Sons Hall will have drinks for sale.\nBuying tickets in advance is rec
 ommended (and appreciated)\, but tickets will also be for sale at the door
 .\nCheck out the amazing bands.\nDirty Cello – internationally touring b
 luegrass and blues band\nLaurie Lewis – one of the founders of Califor..
 .\n\n$5.00\n\nTickets: https://notloudconcerts.com\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/napa-5-folk-festival/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Napa-5
 -Folk-Festival.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Native Sons of the Golden West\, 927 Coombs St. Napa\, CA 94559
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/napa-5-folk-festival/
END:VEVENT
