DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free Concerts & Food Trucks: “Civic Center Soundtrack
 ” (Every Tue/Thu)\nJon Bauer c/o Illuminate\nSan Francisco’s free lunc
 htime concert series is back. The Civic Center Soundtrack returns for its 
 third season starting Tuesday\, April 14\, 2026\, bringing live music to F
 ulton Plaza twice a week through October.\n\nConcerts take place Tuesdays 
 and Thursdays from 12 pm to 3 pm outside the San Francisco Public Library\
 , featuring three performers each day spanning a mix of genres and local t
 alent.\n\nNew for 2026: A rotating lineup of food trucks will join the fes
 tivities\, turning the plaza into a lively midday hangout for downtown wor
 kers\, residents\, and anyone looking for a free break with live music.\n\
 nLaunched in 2024\, the series has hosted more than 100 free concerts and 
 is part of ongoing efforts to activate public spaces in the Civic Center n
 eighborhood.\n\nCivic Center Soundtrack 2026\nWhen: Tuesdays & Thursdays\,
  12 pm to 3 pmDates: April 14 through October 2026Where: Fulton Plaza (out
 side the Main Library)\, Civic CenterCost: Free\nView the full lineup\nBri
 ng your lunch or grab something from the food trucks and enjoy a free outd
 oor show in the heart of downtown.\n\nUpcoming SF’s Free Concerts & Food
  Trucks: “Civic Center Soundtrack” (Every Tue/Thu) Events\nTue 10/6 SF
 ’s Free Concerts & Food Trucks: “Civic Center Soundtrack” (Every Tue
 /Thu)Thu 10/8 SF’s Free Concerts & Food Trucks: “Civic Center Soundtra
 ck” (Every Tue/Thu)Tue 10/13 SF’s Free Concerts & Food Trucks: “Civi
 c Center Sound...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://illuminate.org/venues/fulton
 -street-plaza/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-concerts-food-tr
 ucks-civic-center-soundtrack-every-tue-thu-56/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Civic-
 Center-Soundtrack.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Fulton Plaza\, Fulton and Larkin\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-concerts-food-trucks-civic-center-sou
 ndtrack-every-tue-thu-56/
END:VEVENT
