DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Nest Tour\nMontell 
 Fish\nFriday\, October 30 | The Castro\n\nMontell Fish is a musician and m
 ultidisciplinary creative force whose genre-agnostic sound and the world h
 e’s built around it has garnered over 4.2 billion streams to-date and a 
 devoted global audience. Across critically-acclaimed solo albums JAMIE and
  CHARLOTTE\, as well as a collection of world-expanding side projects unde
 r mysterious monikers like dj gummy bear\, Montell has proven himself to b
 e one of alternative pop music’s most tantalizing and innovative voices\
 , fusing R&B\, indie and electronic influences to form a wholly unique son
 ic identity. Beyond the music\, Montell’s creative practice is all encom
 passing\, debuting as a film composer earlier this year on Brian Tetsuro I
 vie’s first narrative feature Anima\, as well as launching his own cloth
 ing brand Jamie Charlotte Marshall this Summer.\n\nall ages\nAnother Plane
 t Entertainment presents: The Nest Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: 
