DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nMedium Build\n\nSaturday\, October 31 | 
 ​The Regency Ballroom\n\nMedium Build’s vision is to take the sense of
  community his music creates far beyond wherever he calls home. Last year 
 was busy for Medium Build\, opening shows for Lewis Capaldi\, Matt Maeson\
 , and FINNEAS\, while selling out his headlining tour across N. America an
 d playing shows in Europe on the heels of his Health EP. 2024 proves to be
  no different\, with a EU / UK tour supporting Holly Humberstone\, Califor
 nia dates with Tyler Childers\, his biggest US headline tour to date\, and
  a handful of major festivals punctuated by Bonnaroo. All this touring wil
 l support a slew of new music following last year's "In My Room"\, which h
 as already won the hearts of peers\, and been championed by BBC1\, Alt Nat
 ion\, and Zane Lowe.\n\nMedium Build is partnering with PLUS1 so that $1 f
 rom every ticket sold goes to REVERB and their work creating a more sustai
 nable music industry and empowering fans to take action on environmental a
 nd social issues. https://reverb.org/ If tickets in the accessible section
  are unavailable\, please reach out to the venue for accommodations. Pleas
 e note\, orders in violation of the published ticket limit are subject to 
 cancellation without notice. Ticket prices may fluctuate\, at any time\, b
 ased on demand.\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.
 theregencyballroom.com/events/detail/?event_id=1494104\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/10/31/medium-build-presents-the-king-of-having-fun
 -on-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
