DESCRIPTION:“Castro Art Mart” 2026: Drag\, Music + Art (1st Sundays)\n
 Join us for Castro Art Mart\, a vibrant community event celebrating local 
 creativity!\nExperience a lively day in the heart of The Castro as Castro 
 Art Mart brings together talented local artists\, makers\, musicians\, and
  performers for an unforgettable celebration of art\, culture\, and connec
 tion. Held every first Sunday of the month\, this open-air community marke
 t showcases unique handmade goods\, original artwork\, live entertainment\
 , and special performances that reflect the vibrant spirit of San Francisc
 o’s creative community.\nBest of all\, this event is completely FREE and
  open to everyone! Bring your friends\, bring your family\, and spend the 
 day supporting local artists while enjoying an inspiring and welcoming nei
 ghborhood experience.\n\nHighlights:\nArt & Handmade Goods by Local Artist
 s\nLive Drag Performances\nMusic by Local Musicians\nA Celebration of Crea
 tivity in The Castro\nEvent Details:\nDates: May 3 – June 7th – July 5
 th – August 2nd – September 6th – October 4th – November 1st – D
 ecember 6th\nTime: 2:00 PM – 8:00 PM\nLocation: Noe St. between Market a
 nd Beaver\, Castro District\, San Francisco\nWant to Participate?\nFor mor
 e information on how to become an artist\, vendor\, or performer:\nhttps:/
 /artyhood.org/castro-art-mart/\nFollow Us for Updates:\nInstagram:\nhttps:
 //www.instagram.com/artyhood_sf\nhttps://instagram.com/castro.artmart\nFac
 ebook:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/artyhoodSF\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Cast
 ro.artmart/\n\nUpcoming...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/c
 astro.artmart/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/castro-art-mart-2026-drag
 -music-art-1st-sundays-7/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/01-Cas
 tro-Art-Mart-Poster.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Noe Street between Market and Beaver\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
