DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17348370@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Renowned for their high quality reproductions of historic Gene
 sis performances since 1993\, The Musical Box takes fans along for a time-
 travel ride\, offering people a chance to relive the magic of this unique 
 experience.\n\nThese replicas has required exhaustive visual\, scenic\, au
 dio and musical research even tracking down the original music instruments
  used at the time. The visual aspect of The Musical Box shows are based on
  thousands of photos and many amateur films taken at the Genesis concerts\
 , as well as the original slides used by the group during their shows.\n\n
 Impressively\, The Musical Box is the only group licensed and supported by
  Genesis and Peter Gabriel and has presented close to 1000 concerts across
  the world to more than one million spectators\, in prestigious amphitheat
 ers such as The Royal Albert Hall in London\, the Olympia in Paris and the
  Bell Center in Montreal.\n\nPeter Gabriel\, who saw the concert was ”re
 ally impressed by the production quality and the attention to detail”\; 
 Steve Hackett and Phil Collins have even joined The Musical Box on stage.\
 n\n''The Musical Box play it better than we did'' stated Phil Collins afte
 r seeing The Musical Box's production in Geneva.\n\nA Musical Box show is 
 a unique opportunity to discover the mystical Genesis concerts and to reli
 ve a historic rock moment.\n\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://tix
 .axs.com/BTg4EgAAAAA6Joe%2fAgAAAADG%2fv%2f%2f%2fwD%2f%2f%2f%2f%2fC0dvbGRlb
 nZvaWNlAP%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https:/
 /dothebay.com/events/2026/11/1/the-musical-box-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32075445/7f9fe665-d736-4cd3-9ca5-8656a2774856.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/1/the-musical-box-tickets
END:VEVENT
