BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Black Angels
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17227487@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:2026 marks the 20th anniversary of the band’s debut album\, 
 Passover (2006)\, a now-classic record that helped define the 21st-century
  psych revival. To celebrate\, The Black Angels - Alex Maas (vocals/bass)\
 , Christian Bland (guitar)\, Stephanie Bailey (drums)\, Jake Garcia (guita
 r)\, and Misti Hamrick (bass) are returning to the road to perform the alb
 um in full\, along with their greatest hits.\n\nFormed in Austin\, Texas i
 n 2004\, The Black Angels have become one of the most influential bands of
  the modern psychedelic rock movement. Drawing inspiration from forebears 
 such as Syd Barrett\, Roky Erickson\, Arthur Lee\, and The Velvet Undergro
 und\, the band crafts a sound that is both reverent to the genre’s roots
  and fiercely forward-looking\, hypnotic\, heavy\, political\, and immersi
 ve.\n\nBeyond their own recordings\, the band’s impact on the global psy
 chedelic community is cemented by their role as founders of Austin Psych F
 est\, one of the world’s most important gatherings for psychedelic\, exp
 erimental\, and underground music.\n\nFollowing albums such as Death Song 
 (2017) and Wilderness of Mirrors (2022) on Partisan Records\, The Black An
 gels continue to evolve while remaining unmistakably themselves: a band th
 at channels the spirit of classic psychedelia into a dark\, modern\, and d
 eeply powerful form.\n\nIf tickets in the accessible section are unavailab
 le\, please reach out to the venue for accommodations. Please note\, order
 s in violation of the published ticket limit are subject to cancellation w
 i...\n\nGoldenvoice Presents: Passover Tour 2026\n\nTickets: https://tix.a
 xs.com/BTg4EgAAAAC78S6%2bAgAAAAD6%2fv%2f%2f%2fwD%2f%2f%2f%2f%2fC0dvbGRlbnZ
 vaWNlAP%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/11/5/the-black-angels-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\
 nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/black-angels/
