 p to this moment\, Lucy Bedroque gained a cult following in the shadowy se
 ctors of the online underground\, with a break-out debut LP “Sisterhood
 ” as Lostrushi. This is the name that raised them to notoriety alongside
  peers 9lives\, prettifun\, and egobreak. The new material continues furth
 er down the same path\, combining cutthroat rage\, with the eclecticism an
 d sensitivities of Stereolab\, Radiohead\, and Deftones. While forging the
 ir distinct multi-media surrealism\, Mark also found a penchant for custom
