DESCRIPTION:Creative Collective SFThe San Francisco Diwali Festival brings
  together contemporary and traditional South Asian performances for a vibr
 ant outdoor celebration. Set in the beautiful Yerba Buena Gardens\, this f
 ree\, all-ages event invites you to relax\, dance\, and celebrate Diwali.\
 nEnjoy live performances throughout the day\, along with a curated selecti
 on of local makers\, artisan vendors\, and delicious food. Bring your fami
 ly and friends for an afternoon of music\, culture\, and celebration!\nExp
 erience Diwali in the heart of San Francisco with live music\, dance\, and
  family friendly fun!\n\nFeaturing Alam Khan\, two-time Grammy-nominated a
 rtist\, Raaga School of Music\, Rang De Bollywood Dance Company\, DJ Mumba
 i Rani\, and The Dhol King.\nThe San Francisco Diwali Festival is presente
 d by Yerba Buena Gardens Conservancy in partnership with Creative Collecti
 ve SF.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sanfranciscodiwalifestival.eventbrite.c
 om\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-diwali-festival-yerba-b
 uena-gardens-2026/\nSource: Funcheap SF
