DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nJorja Smith\n\nMonday\,
  November 16 | The Castro\n\nMulti-award-winning singer and songwriter Jor
 ja Smith announces her new album\, “What Are The Odds” featuring sole 
 production from P2J [Beyoncé\, Stormzy\, Burna Boy].\n\nThe album arrives
  ten years after ‘Blue Lights’\, the Platinum-selling debut single tha
 t introduced Jorja’s singular voice and set the course for one of Britis
 h music’s most influential musicians. Since 2016\, Jorja has delivered t
 wo No.3 albums – Gold selling debut “Lost & Found” (2018) and “Fal
 ling Or Flying” (2023) – and collaborated with global superstars inclu
 ding Kendrick Lamar\, Burna Boy\, Stormzy\, Drake and Giggs. The Walsall b
 orn singer and songwriter has won two BRITs and received nominations for a
  Grammy\, an Ivor Novello and the Mercury Prize and currently counts over 
 11 million monthly listeners and 4.7 billion streams on Spotify alone\, wi
 th eight million followers across socials.\n\nJorja had already had a run 
 of major moments in 2026\, including a performance on the debut season of 
 Saturday Night Live UK \, her appearance on the soundtrack to Riz Ahmed’
 s Prime Video series ‘Bait’ with ‘Price Of It All’\, and the annou
 ncement that she will co-headline ‘All Points East’ in Victoria Park o
 n Friday 21 August alongside Tems.\n\nWith her third album “What Are The
  Odds\,” Jorja continues to build on her legacy with a euphoric offering
  rooted firmly in dance music. Confidently channelling UKG\, Grime\, 2Step
 \, Funky House\, Soulful House...\n\nall ages\nSold out\nAnother Planet En
 tertainment presents\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaste
 r.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticke
 tmaster.com%2Fjorja-smith-san-francisco-california-11-16-2026%2Fevent%2F1C
 0064FF17138A51%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/16/jorja-smith-tickets\nSour
 ce: DoTheBay
