DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Joint Tour\nHamilto
 n Leithauser + Rostam\nWednesday\, November 18 | The Castro\n\nAt the time
  I Had a Dream That You Were Mine was first released\, the Hamilton Leitha
 user and Rostam were best known for their work in two of the most influent
 ial rock bands of the era: Hamilton as lead singer in The Walkmen and Rost
 am as the co-songwriter and producer behind Vampire Weekend. The inspired 
 collaboration was born of friendship\, and mutual admiration\, but grew in
 to a synergistic creative partnership that birthed a timeless album of bea
 utifully evocative songs. I Had a Dream That You Were Mine is a delightful
 ly immersive album\, built around Rostam’s meticulous\, expansive produc
 tion and Hamilton’s distinctive\, wild vocal range. Unlike anything eith
 er artist had done before\, the album’s stylistic flourishes include doo
 -wop\, country-rock\, baroque pop\, folk\, and spellbinding torch songs. T
 ogether\, the lauded musicians found a unique flair for the dramatic which
  made their handful of live performances a thrilling experience\; ten year
 s on\, these rare live shows are not to be missed!\n\nall ages\nAnother Pl
 anet Entertainment presents: The Joint Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nTicke
 ts: https://thecastro.com/events/hamilton-leithauser-and-rostam-261118\nDe
 tails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/18/hamilton-leithauser-rostam-t
 ickets\nSource: DoTheBay
