SUMMARY:The Music of Hey Arnold Live! Feat. Jim Lang & the PS 118 AllStars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17778705@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:2nd Show Added by Popular Demand!\n\nAnother Planet Entertainm
 ent presents\nThe Music of Hey Arnold Live! Featuring Jim Lang & the PS 11
 8 AllStars\nwith special guest Craig Bartlett\n\nWednesday\, November 25 |
  The Castro\n\nThe Music of Hey Arnold! Live featuring Jim Lang & The PS 1
 18 AllStars celebrates the 30th anniversary of one of television’s most 
 cherished animated series.\n\nLed by award winning composer Jim Lang\, bes
 t known for his unforgettable theme music\, original songs\, and score for
  Hey Arnold!\, this one of a kind concert brings the music of the series t
 o life on stage. Blending jazz\, hip hop\, blues\, R&B and funk\, Lang cre
 ated a sound unlike anything else on television\, helping give Hey Arnold!
  its heart\, warmth\, humor and soul. Thirty years later\, the music conti
 nues to connect with fans of all ages and inspire musicians around the wor
 ld.\n\nPerformed by Jim Lang and The PS 118 AllStars\, the evening feature
 s the show’s unforgettable themes\, fan favorite songs\, and some of the
  moments that made Hey Arnold! so special. Accompanied by multimedia visua
 ls and stories from behind the music\, the performance also includes a spe
 cial guest appearance by series creator Craig Bartlett.\n\nWhether you gre
 w up with Hey Arnold! or are discovering its music for the first time\, th
 is 30th anniversary celebration is a chance to experience one of animation
 ’s most distinctive and enduring scores performed live by the composer w
 ho created it.\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents\nListed 
 time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/42
 72?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fthe-music-of-he
 y-arnold-live-san-francisco-california-11-25-2026%2Fevent%2F1C00651AE49825
 89%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/25/the-music-of-hey-arnold-live-feat-jim
 -lang-and-the-ps-118-allstars-with-special-guestcraig-bartlett-tickets\nSo
 urce: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34121976/0e5d29e5-ef83-48d7-8ec4-1324d24d558c.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/25/the-music-of-hey-arnold-live-fe
 at-jim-lang-and-the-ps-118-allstars-with-special-guestcraig-bartlett-ticke
