DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free DFT Monthly Block Party: “Downtown First Thursda
 ys” (2026)\nInto The Streets\nDowntown First Thursdays is back in 2026 f
 or a full year of street parties in 2026\, starting Jan 1\, 2026\, with a 
 New Year’s Day Edition and returning every first Thursday with a new dow
 ntown block party.\nDJs – Live Performances – Dancing – Drag – Foo
 d Trucks – Shopping – Fashion\, and new surprises every month.\n“DFT
 ” Downtown First Thursdays\nEvery 1st Thursday | 5-10 pm\n2nd St. betwee
 n Market and Howard Streets\, San Francisco\nFREE – All Ages\nCARNAVAL S
 F TAKES OVER DFT:\nCarnaval San Francisco takes over 2nd Street. This is D
 FT\, Carnaval SF style: joyful\, proudly Latino and taking over the street
 s of Downtown SF.\nFeaturing Sonido La Conga\, bringing Mexico City sonide
 ro culture to the heart of Downtown SF. Préndelo con cumbia\, salsa class
 ics\, guaracha y más sonidos auténticos\, with rhythms connecting Méxic
 o\, Cuba\, Puerto Rico\, Colombia\, and beyond. Expect Willie Colón\, Son
 ora Matancera\, tropical classics\, deep cuts and a parade of favorites li
 ghting up the dance floor.\nWith support from Internacional Panchito\, Son
 ido Reina (La Chica del Sabor) and Sonido La Tapatía with Sylvia Caro.\n\
 nCheck out neighborhood afterparties\, free museums and more here!\nEat an
 d Drink Nearby\n\nWe strongly recommend taking public transportation:\nThe
  nearest public transit station is Montgomery Station (MUNI & BART)\nHowar
 d Stage Happy Hour\nJoin the Howard Stage happy hour every month from 5-7P
 M at Howard and 2nd St\, featu...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.dftsf.co
 m\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-free-dft-monthly-block-party-downt
 own-first-thursdays-2026-11/\nSource: Funcheap SF
